---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="For Indian Producers: Reach Global Wellness Buyers"
  description="Ayris Global works with certified Indian producers of herbs, extracts, powders and essential oils, bringing qualified enquiries from buyers in 9 regions. No upfront fees."
>

  <!-- HowTo JSON-LD Schema (Session 28) -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={`{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"HowTo","name":"How Indian Producers Become an Ayris Global Supplier Partner","description":"How certified Indian botanical producers, and producers beyond India, can apply to work with Ayris Global and receive qualified enquiries from international buyers.","step":[{"@type":"HowToStep","position":1,"name":"Send your product overview","text":"Email partnerships@ayrisglobal.in with your product range, certifications held and production capacity. A brief company profile and product list is enough to start."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":2,"name":"We review and respond","text":"Ayris Global reviews every enquiry within 5 working days and responds with an honest assessment of fit."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":3,"name":"Documentation review","text":"Ayris Global requests your documentation package, including CoA, certifications and specification sheets, and reviews it against current buyer requirements."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":4,"name":"Agreement and market activation","text":"If the fit is right, a simple agreement covers scope, fees and working protocols, and Ayris Global begins presenting your products to relevant buyers."}]}`} slot="head" />

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero__inner">
      <span class="eyebrow">Supplier Partnerships</span>
      <h1 class="page-hero__title">For Indian Producers: Your Ingredients, Global Buyers</h1>
      <p class="page-hero__sub">India has producers with strong quality systems who rarely reach international buyers on their own. We run continuous buyer outreach across nine regions and bring qualified enquiries to producers whose documentation is ready for them.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE PROBLEM WE SOLVE -->
  <section class="problem">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="problem__inner">
        <div class="problem__text">
          <span class="section-eyebrow">The Challenge</span>
          <h2 class="section-title">Good producers deserve global reach</h2>
          <p>India has exceptional botanical producers. GMP-certified facilities. Organic-certified farms. Producers who have invested years in building quality systems, getting the right certifications, and perfecting their products. Many of them are hard for international buyers to find.</p>
          <p>International buyers often find it difficult to assess Indian suppliers remotely: which certificates apply, which documents to ask for, and how to compare producers.</p>
          <p>Ayris Global works in that gap. We run continuous buyer outreach across the EU, UK, USA, UAE/GCC, Japan, Korea, ANZ, Southeast Asia and Latin America, and present your ingredients to buyers whose specifications match what you make.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="problem__stats">
          <div class="stat">
            <span class="stat__num">9</span>
            <span class="stat__label">Regions in our buyer outreach</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <span class="stat__num">6</span>
            <span class="stat__label">Ingredient categories we represent</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <span class="stat__num">0</span>
            <span class="stat__label">Upfront fees to supplier partners</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <span class="stat__num">Success</span>
            <span class="stat__label">Fee basis: paid only when business is done</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT WE LOOK FOR -->
  <section class="criteria">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header section-header--light">
        <span class="section-eyebrow section-eyebrow--gold">Who We Partner With</span>
        <h2 class="section-title section-title--white">What we look for in a supplier partner</h2>
        <p class="section-sub section-sub--light">We are selective. We represent producers whose quality and certification standards genuinely match what global buyers require. Here's what that looks like.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="criteria-grid">
        <div class="criterion">
          <span class="criterion__num">01</span>
          <h3>Current certifications</h3>
          <p>GMP, ISO 22000, FSSAI as a minimum. Organic (NPOP/NOP), Halal, and Kosher are significant advantages. All certifications must be current, from recognised certifying bodies, and available for buyer review.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="criterion">
          <span class="criterion__num">02</span>
          <h3>Third-party tested product</h3>
          <p>CoA from an accredited independent laboratory - covering active content, microbiological limits, heavy metals, and pesticide residues. Buyers in regulated markets will require this before any purchase decision.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="criterion">
          <span class="criterion__num">03</span>
          <h3>Documentation readiness</h3>
          <p>Current certificates, recent batch CoAs from an accredited laboratory, and a technical data sheet and safety data sheet available on request. Buyers review documents before any further step.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="criterion">
          <span class="criterion__num">04</span>
          <h3>Consistent supply</h3>
          <p>Ability to fulfil repeat orders at consistent quality across batches. International buyers build formulation programmes around their ingredient supply - supply chain reliability is non-negotiable for long-term partnerships.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="criterion">
          <span class="criterion__num">05</span>
          <h3>Export experience or readiness</h3>
          <p>Experience with export documentation - or willingness to work with a clearing and forwarding agent. Phytosanitary certificates, certificates of origin, and export compliance are prerequisites for international shipments.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="criterion">
          <span class="criterion__num">06</span>
          <h3>Responsive communication</h3>
          <p>The ability to respond promptly to buyer queries - specifications, pricing, lead times, custom requirements. International buyers operate across time zones and expect timely, professional communication.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT WE OFFER SUPPLIERS -->
  <section class="offer">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">What You Get</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">What Ayris Global brings to the partnership</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="offer-grid">
        <div class="offer-item">
          <h3>Qualified enquiries</h3>
          <p>Enquiries from buyers across the EU, UK, USA, UAE/GCC, Japan, Korea, ANZ, Southeast Asia and Latin America, presented to you through Ayris Global.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="offer-item">
          <h3>Market-matched positioning</h3>
          <p>Each market asks for different certifications, specifications and documents. We help you present your products in the form each market expects.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="offer-item">
          <h3>Documentation support</h3>
          <p>We help you ensure your documentation package meets the requirements of your target markets - and we communicate clearly with buyers about what is available and what can be obtained.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="offer-item">
          <h3>No upfront cost</h3>
          <p>There are no listing fees, marketing charges or upfront payments. We are paid only when business is done, so our incentive is aligned with yours.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="offer-item">
          <h3>Confidential, qualified introductions</h3>
          <p>We qualify every enquiry for market, volume, specification and timeline before bringing it to you. Enquiries are presented through Ayris Global, and buyer and producer identities are kept confidential on both sides.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="offer-item">
          <h3>Long-term relationship</h3>
          <p>We are building a portfolio of suppliers we can represent with confidence over years. We invest in understanding your product range, your capabilities, and your ambitions - and we grow with you.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CATEGORIES WE REPRESENT -->
  <section class="categories">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header section-header--light">
        <span class="section-eyebrow section-eyebrow--gold">Product Categories</span>
        <h2 class="section-title section-title--white">What we represent</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="categories-grid">
        <div class="category-item">
          <span class="category-item__num">01</span>
          <h3>Ayurvedic Ingredients</h3>
          <p>Ashwagandha, Shatavari, Brahmi, Triphala, Guduchi, and the full range of classical Ayurvedic botanicals - in extract, powder, and standardised forms.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="category-item">
          <span class="category-item__num">02</span>
          <h3>Herbal Extracts</h3>
          <p>HPLC-standardised botanical extracts with defined active content - supplied as dry powders or liquid extracts with full analytical documentation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="category-item">
          <span class="category-item__num">03</span>
          <h3>Botanical Powders</h3>
          <p>Whole-plant and single-part botanical powders - dried, milled, and sieved to specification. Conventional, organic, and spray-dried formats.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="category-item">
          <span class="category-item__num">04</span>
          <h3>Nutraceutical Ingredients</h3>
          <p>Active botanical ingredients for supplement and functional food applications - curcumin, piperine and other plant-derived actives.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="category-item">
          <span class="category-item__num">05</span>
          <h3>Essential Oils</h3>
          <p>Steam-distilled, cold-pressed, and CO₂-extracted botanical oils - GC-MS tested by the producer. Spice oils, floral absolutes, and medicinal plant oils.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="category-item">
          <span class="category-item__num">06</span>
          <h3>Natural Wellness Ingredients</h3>
          <p>Edible botanicals, functional flowers, and wellness-grade plant ingredients - rose petals, hibiscus, chamomile, tulsi, and dried botanical blends.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HOW TO APPLY -->
  <section class="apply">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="apply__inner">
        <div class="apply__text">
          <span class="section-eyebrow">Get Started</span>
          <h2 class="section-title">How to become an Ayris Global supplier partner</h2>
          <p>We review every supplier enquiry personally. The process is straightforward - no lengthy forms, no upfront commitments. We start with a conversation, then move to product review if there's a fit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="apply__steps">
          <div class="apply-step">
            <span class="apply-step__num">1</span>
            <div>
              <h4>Send us your product overview</h4>
              <p>Email us at <a href="mailto:partnerships@ayrisglobal.in">partnerships@ayrisglobal.in</a> with your product range, certifications held, and production capacity. A brief company profile and product list is enough to start.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="apply-step">
            <span class="apply-step__num">2</span>
            <div>
              <h4>We review and respond</h4>
              <p>We review every enquiry within 5 working days and respond with our honest assessment of fit. If we see potential, we'll schedule a call to understand your products and capabilities in more detail.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="apply-step">
            <span class="apply-step__num">3</span>
            <div>
              <h4>Product review and documentation check</h4>
              <p>We'll request your documentation package first: CoA, certifications and specification sheets. We review these against what our current buyers are looking for.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="apply-step">
            <span class="apply-step__num">4</span>
            <div>
              <h4>Partnership agreement and market activation</h4>
              <p>If the fit is right, we formalise the partnership with a simple agreement covering scope, fees and working protocols. Then we start presenting your products to relevant buyers.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- BEYOND INDIA -->
  <section class="beyond" id="beyond-india">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="beyond__inner">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Producers Beyond India</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Not based in India?</h2>
        <p>Some of the botanicals our buyers ask for are grown outside India. If you produce a botanical ingredient elsewhere and can share current certificates and recent batch CoAs, we would like to hear from you. The same criteria, process and confidentiality apply.</p>
        <p>Email <a href="mailto:partnerships@ayrisglobal.in">partnerships@ayrisglobal.in</a> with "Producer - [your country]" in the subject line.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-band__inner">
        <h2 class="cta-band__title">Ready to reach global buyers?</h2>
        <p class="cta-band__sub">Send us your product range and certifications. We'll tell you within 5 working days whether there's a fit, and what we can do for you.</p>
        <a href="mailto:partnerships@ayrisglobal.in" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">Email partnerships@ayrisglobal.in</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    background: var(--mist);
    padding: 7rem 1.5rem 5rem;
    text-align: center; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--turmeric);}
  .page-hero__inner { max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .page-hero__title {
    font-family: 'DM Serif Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.4rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .page-hero__sub {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.82;
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .container { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }

  .section-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }
  .section-header--light { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }
  .section-eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .section-eyebrow--gold { color: var(--ink); }
  .section-title {
    font-family: 'DM Serif Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .section-title--white { color: var(--ink); }
  .section-sub {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--slate);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .section-sub--light { color: var(--slate); }

  /* PROBLEM */
  .problem { background: var(--paper); padding: 6rem 0; }
  .problem__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .problem__text .section-eyebrow { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .problem__text .section-title { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .problem__text p {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.82;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .problem__stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding-top: 4.8rem;
  }
  .stat {
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid rgba(var(--ink-rgb),0.09);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.1rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .stat__num {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'DM Serif Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .stat__label {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--slate);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* CRITERIA */
  .criteria { background: var(--mist); padding: 6rem 0; }
  .criteria-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .criterion {
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid rgba(var(--turmeric-rgb),0.14);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
  }
  .criterion__num {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'DM Serif Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    color: var(--slate);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .criterion h3 {
    font-family: 'DM Serif Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 0.7rem;
  }
  .criterion p {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.855rem;
    color: var(--slate);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* OFFER */
  .offer { background: var(--white); padding: 6rem 0; }
  .offer-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  .offer-item {
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid rgba(var(--ink-rgb),0.08);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
  }
  .offer-item h3 {
    font-family: 'DM Serif Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }
  .offer-item p {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--slate);
    line-height: 1.78;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* CATEGORIES */
  .categories { background: var(--mist); padding: 6rem 0; }
  .categories-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .category-item {
    border-top: 2px solid rgba(var(--turmeric-rgb),0.3);
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
  }
  .category-item__num {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .category-item h3 {
    font-family: 'DM Serif Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
  }
  .category-item p {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--slate);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* APPLY */
  .apply { background: var(--paper); padding: 6rem 0; }
  .apply__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .apply__text .section-eyebrow { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .apply__text .section-title { margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  .apply__text p {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--slate);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .apply__steps { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.75rem; }
  .apply-step {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 44px 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .apply-step__num {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--turmeric);
    font-family: 'DM Serif Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .apply-step h4 {
    font-family: 'DM Serif Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
  }
  .apply-step p {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.855rem;
    color: var(--slate);
    line-height: 1.72;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .apply-step a {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: underline;
  text-decoration-color: var(--turmeric);
  text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
  text-underline-offset: 4px;
}
  .apply-step a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  /* CTA */
  .cta-band {
    background: var(--ink);
    padding: 6rem 0;
    text-align: center; border-top: 4px solid var(--turmeric);}
  .cta-band__inner { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .cta-band__title {
    font-family: 'DM Serif Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.5vw, 2.4rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--paper);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .cta-band__sub {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: rgba(var(--paper-rgb),0.7);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0 0 2.2rem;
  }
  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.8rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }
  .btn--primary { background: var(--turmeric); color: var(--ink); border: 2px solid var(--turmeric); }
  .btn--primary:hover { background: var(--turmeric-hover); border-color: var(--turmeric-hover); }
  .btn--lg { padding: 1rem 2.2rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .problem__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
    .problem__stats { padding-top: 0; }
    .criteria-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .offer-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .categories-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .apply__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .criteria-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .offer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .categories-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .problem__stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
  /* BEYOND INDIA */
  .beyond { background: var(--white); padding: 5rem 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--ink-rgb),0.08); }
  .beyond__inner { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
  .beyond__inner p {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--slate);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .beyond__inner a { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; text-decoration: underline;
  text-decoration-color: var(--turmeric);
  text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
  text-underline-offset: 4px;
}
  .beyond__inner a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
